{"version":1,"key":"card:590","content":{"id":590,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 作为识别用户的缺点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 是和机器绑定而不是和用户绑定的，如果一台机器上允许多个用户登录，则无法识别"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在有的场景下，每次用户登录，网管都会分配新的 IP 地址"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"出于安全性以及 IP 地址资源的紧缺性的考虑，大多数用户都通过 NAT 与外部互联网连接，使用的都是 NAT 的公网 IP，无法获取到用户的真实 IP"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在客户和服务器之间存在代理，服务器与代理连接而不是与客户端连接，虽然存在 Client-IP 和 X-Forward-For 请求头来传递源 IP 地址，但是不一定所有的代理都支持"}]}]}]}],"tags":["网络","用户认证","HTTP"],"createTime":1752457481555,"updateTime":1758084752600,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1758084752600}}